Reason: Let a module decide that a class may wield a two-handed weapon in the main hand with a shield in the off hand (the Crusader with Heavenly Strength), through the core's own Titan's Grip rule: Player::CanTitanGrip() also asks the module, so the equip checks, the off-hand auto-unequip and IsTwoHandUsed all follow it live.
Target: AzerothCore at core-commit.txt, after patches 0001-0030. Default: stock, only the Titan's Grip talent (and a hook answer of false).

